        "圆内极点为 $z=0,\\pm\\pi/2$。",
        "留数分别为 $1/2,-e^{\\pi^2/4}/2,-e^{\\pi^2/4}/2$。",
        "故积分为 $$2\\pi i\\left(\\frac12-e^{\\pi^2/4}\\right)=\\pi i(1-2e^{\\pi^2/4}).$$。"
